    "detailed_description": "Life isn't easy as a futuristic rideshare driver, especially when people keep leaving bees in your passenger seat. Take the helm in this cyberpunk comedy. Transport the eccentric citizens of the city. Escape your past, and like, overcome class inequity or something.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/84e5c4020a63940240a18e976f5ad655.poster.avif?t=1742056058\" width=642 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/84e5c4020a63940240a18e976f5ad655.webm?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/84e5c4020a63940240a18e976f5ad655.mp4?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take the helm in this cyberpunk uber driver narrative mystery. Traverse the city delivering contraband and nefarious passengers. Rekindle old contacts and reconnect with an underworld you were trying to leave behind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/72ed46ba7724850a227d000703d4f973.poster.avif?t=1742056058\" width=402 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/72ed46ba7724850a227d000703d4f973.webm?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/72ed46ba7724850a227d000703d4f973.mp4?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Take The Helm</strong>: From a 1st person perspective, accept jobs and transport citizens around a futuristic city<br></li><li><strong>Uncover Mysteries</strong>: Converse with passengers to learn about themselves, the city, and uncover a greater mystery<br></li><li><strong>Do Something About The Bees</strong>: bzzz<br></li><li><strong>Rekindle old contacts</strong>: Develop meaningful connections, or sever ties. <br></li><li><strong>Escape your past</strong>: Uncover your own story and escape your past.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/86f712f57d13122904103e38721f93af.poster.avif?t=1742056058\" width=626 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/86f712f57d13122904103e38721f93af.webm?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952840/extras/86f712f57d13122904103e38721f93af.mp4?t=1742056058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
